WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
BUILD 054. A ROOM CAN ADAPT WITHOUT DECIDING FOR A PERSON.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
DECLARE THE PERSON, TASK, CONTEXT, CONSTRAINTS, CONFLICTS, AUTHORITY, AND AVAILABLE CONTROLS.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
RECOMPUTE PROPOSED LIGHT, QUIET-ZONE, AND SEATING SETTINGS WHEN THE SCENARIO CHANGES.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
ONE PERSON’S SUPPORT MAY COMPLICATE ANOTHER’S TASK. KEEP TRADEOFFS REVIEWABLE.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
PROPOSE SETTINGS—DO NOT ACTUATE, INFER TRAITS, OR CLAIM SAFETY OR ACCESSIBILITY.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
KEEP THE PERSON IN CONTROL: CONSENT, OVERRIDE, FALLBACK, AND HUMAN REVIEW.
